        "mission_intent": "Team, as we approach the decommissioning phase for the legacy HRMS platform (modules 3 through 7), I need you to draft a comprehensive disposal and sanitization specification aligned with our systems security engineering framework. The spec should cover sanitization of all system elements and associated life cycle artifacts\u2014technical manuals, operations procedures, performance reports, incident logs, and trend data\u2014ensuring removal of sensitive proprietary IP and personnel data before any disposal action. Please identify the specific sanitization techniques applicable to each artifact type and technology, including clearing, purging, cryptographic erase, and physical destruction methods, and call out any specialized redaction approaches needed for particular media or document formats. The spec must also address compliance with applicable data retention regulations, particularly where laws prohibit premature destruction, and flag any documentation, tooling, or equipment that should have been procured during design and implementation but may be missing. Finally, incorporate controls to confirm that any removed system elements and their parts not intended for reuse are verified destroyed and cannot reenter the supply chain through recycling or refurbishment channels. Please have a draft ready for review by end of next week.",
